   "level": 1,
   "description": "You maintain a network of low-profile contacts and keep a rotating cover identity. You have advantage on Deception checks while using an active disguise and on Stealth checks made to blend into urban crowds. Once per short rest, you can leverage a contact to gain advantage on a single social check to obtain restricted information.",
