     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  "personality_options": {
   "traits": [
    "I fade into a crowd without a thought.",
    "I keep three names ready and two are lies.",
    "I compliment guards because people watch less when they feel seen.",
    "I leave no trace and expect the same of allies."
   ],
   "ideals": [
    "Secrecy. Truth is a weapon; I choose when to draw it.",
    "Loyalty. I protect my network as they protect me.",
    "Freedom. Locks exist to be opened."
